# Smoke 10, SEND, windows: the explicit dry-run send rehearsal. It opens its own fresh 2551Q for Q3 and repeats the
# per-return answers before pressing Queue and Continue, so it does not use the pre-send recipe's end state. The
# taxpayer/profile facts are already set by the suite; the income-type card is not repeated because queue saves it there.
# The runner refuses this recipe without --allow-send.
click sb-new
wait_until new-return-2551Q --timeout-ms 5000
click new-return-2551Q
click new-return-period-trigger
wait_until new-return-period-opt-3 --timeout-ms 5000
click new-return-period-opt-3
click new-return-open
wait_until form-page --timeout-ms 20000 --screenshot
click fp-pill-list --screenshot
click fp-nav-attention --screenshot
type fp-frm2551Qv2018:telNo 09170000000
type fp-txtEmail#occurrence-1 e2e@example.com
click fp-frm2551Qv2018:taxTreaty_2 --screenshot
click fp-frm2551Qv2018:taxRateNA --screenshot
# The queue rehearsal opens its own fresh return, where Item 15 (creditable percentage tax withheld) starts empty
# and is required: fill it with zero so Check has nothing left (on main it was filled by money-boxes' return).
# The saved-answer toast can sit over the Part II header; a money box takes a programmatic value only once it
# has been focused and typed into, so the box is clicked and typed like a person does (the next click commits it).
wait_until toast --absent --timeout-ms 8000
click fp-nav-2
wait_until fp-frm2551Qv2018:txt15 --timeout-ms 5000
click fp-frm2551Qv2018:txt15
type fp-frm2551Qv2018:txt15 0
click fp-nav-0 --screenshot
click fp-check
wait_until fp-pill-count --timeout-ms 1000 --absent
click fp-queue --screenshot
wait_until fp-send-line --timeout-ms 20000 --screenshot
